<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-046" chapter-id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete" source-id="s-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete-ws2118581">
  <p id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">弟<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete:p001:m0001" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABC">悅</persName>，亦有美稱，歷侍中、<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete:p001:m0012" ref="83f_ecc_ef1">臨海王子頊</persName>前將軍長史、南郡太守。<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete:p001:m0028" ref="902_55f_656">晉安王子勛</persName>建偽號，召拜為吏部尚書，與<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete:p001:m0046" ref="8yj_s5k_qoq">鄧琬</persName>共輔偽政。及事敗，<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete:p001:m0057" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABC">悅</persName>殺<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete:p001:m0059" ref="8yj_s5k_qoq">琬</persName>歸降，復為太子中庶子。後拜雍州刺史。泰始六年，明帝於巴郡置三巴校尉，以<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyue-complete:p001:m0095" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABC">悅</persName>補之，加持節、輔師將軍，領巴郡太守。未拜，卒。</p>
</text>
